Package: heos-home
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-venv, python3-fastapi (>= 0.115), python3-starlette (>= 0.46), python3-pydantic (>= 2.10), python3-uvicorn (>= 0.32), python3-websockets (>= 15), python3-httpx (>= 0.28), python3-cryptography (>= 43), adduser, systemd
Homepage: https://github.com/KDenisPi/heos
Description: HEOS Home Controller - local controller for HEOS amplifiers
 A local-only service and web app (PWA) for a Denon / Marantz HEOS device
 such as the Marantz PM7000N: playback, queue, DLNA and Amazon Music sources,
 HEOS Favorites, local playlists, inputs and power.
 .
 The Python environment is not part of the package: after the first install
 run /opt/heos-home/setup-env.sh once.
